@startuml
skinparam padding 2
skinparam shadowing false

title Yoda & SRAM integration (v2.1)

actor       Researcher          as researcher
actor       "Group Manager"     as groupmanager
participant Yoda                as yoda
participant SRAM                as SRAM
participant "Institutional IdP" as IdP


== Create a research group (Yoda group) ==
autonumber 1.0
groupmanager -> yoda: Create research group
activate yoda

alt external user
  yoda -> yoda: Add user invitation status
  yoda -[#darkblue]> SRAM: Invite user to external user CO\n(SRAM collaboration invite API)
  activate SRAM
  SRAM --[#darkblue]> yoda: 200 OK
  SRAM -->> researcher: Invitation mail for external user CO
  deactivate SRAM
end

yoda --> groupmanager: Research group created
deactivate yoda


== Add user to research group (Yoda group) ==
autonumber 2.0
groupmanager -> yoda: Add user to research group
activate yoda

alt external user
  yoda -> yoda: Add user to research group
  yoda -[#darkblue]> SRAM: Invite user to external user CO\n(SRAM collaboration invite API)
  activate SRAM
  SRAM --[#darkblue]> yoda: 200 OK
  SRAM -->> researcher: Invitation mail for external user CO
  deactivate SRAM
end

yoda --> groupmanager: User added to research group
deactivate yoda


== External user accepting invite (Yoda group) ==
autonumber 3.0
researcher -> SRAM: Follow SRAM external user CO invitation link
activate SRAM
SRAM -> IdP: Redirect to IdP (Log in to accept the invite)
activate IdP
IdP --> SRAM: User authenticated
deactivate IdP
SRAM -> SRAM: User added to external user CO
deactivate SRAM


== Synchronize with SRAM external user CO (Yoda group) ==
autonumber 4.0
yoda -[#darkblue]> SRAM: Get external user CO (SRAM get CO API)
activate yoda
activate SRAM
SRAM --[#darkblue]> yoda: 200 OK
deactivate SRAM

alt user does not exist in external user CO
  yoda -> yoda: Add user invitation status
  yoda -[#darkblue]> SRAM: Invite user to external user CO\n(SRAM collaboration invite API)
  activate SRAM
  SRAM --[#darkblue]> yoda: 200 OK
  SRAM -->> researcher: Invitation mail for external user CO
  deactivate SRAM
end

deactivate yoda


== Create research group linked with SRAM CO ==
autonumber 5.0
groupmanager -> yoda: Create research group
activate yoda
yoda -> yoda: Add research group
yoda -[#darkblue]> SRAM: Create CO (SRAM post new CO API)
activate SRAM
SRAM --[#darkblue]> yoda: 200 OK (CO identifier)
deactivate SRAM
yoda -> yoda: Link CO identifier to research group
yoda --> groupmanager: Research group created
deactivate yoda


== Add user to research group (linked with SRAM CO) ==
autonumber 6.0
groupmanager -> yoda: Add user to research group
activate yoda
yoda -> yoda: Add user to research group
yoda -[#darkblue]> SRAM: Invite user to CO (SRAM collaboration invite API)
activate SRAM
SRAM --[#darkblue]> yoda: 200 OK
SRAM -->> researcher: Invitation mail for collaboration
deactivate SRAM
yoda -> yoda: Add user invitation status
deactivate yoda


== User accepting invite (research group linked with SRAM CO) ==
autonumber 7.0
researcher -> SRAM: Follow SRAM CO invitation link
activate SRAM
SRAM -> IdP: Redirect to IdP (Log in to accept the invite)
activate IdP
IdP --> SRAM: User authenticated
deactivate IdP
SRAM -> SRAM: User added to research group CO
deactivate SRAM


== Change user role in research group (linked with SRAM CO) ==
autonumber 8.0
groupmanager -> yoda: Change user role in research group
activate yoda
yoda -> yoda: Update user role in research group
yoda -[#darkblue]> SRAM: Change user role in CO\n(SRAM update CO membership API)
activate SRAM
SRAM --[#darkblue]> yoda: 200 OK
deactivate SRAM
yoda --> groupmanager: User role changed in research group
deactivate yoda


== Remove user from research group (linked with SRAM CO) ==
autonumber 9.0
groupmanager -> yoda: Remove user from research group
activate yoda
yoda -> yoda: Remove user from research group
yoda -[#darkblue]> SRAM: Remove user from CO (SRAM delete CO membership API)
activate SRAM
SRAM --[#darkblue]> yoda: 200 OK
deactivate SRAM
yoda --> groupmanager: User removed from research group
deactivate yoda


== Remove research group (linked with SRAM CO) ==
autonumber 10.0
groupmanager -> yoda: Remove research group
activate yoda
yoda -> yoda: Remove research group
yoda -[#darkblue]> SRAM: Remove CO (SRAM delete CO API)
activate SRAM
SRAM --[#darkblue]> yoda: 200 OK
deactivate SRAM
yoda --> groupmanager: Research group removed
deactivate yoda

@enduml
